# 统一行尾：Go/TS/Vue 源码强制 LF，防止 Windows 提交引入 CRLF 导致 gofmt/golangci-lint 失败
*.go text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.vue text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
